# scripts used in the SoE project
#1. SoE_Nimble_rangewide.R : script to run the rangewide scale of effect analysis for a species
#2. SoE_nimble_bcr.R: script to run BCR wide scale of effect analysis of a species
#3. time_to_decimal.R: helper function used inside the BLISS function
#4. predictive_model: predictive gradient boosting model 
